// A cycle (DD-12 §12, N27): no node is free of incoming arcs, so the first in
// declaration order, `a`, is the root, and the BFS breaks `c -> a`. The
// broken arc is still drawn, straight, by the host (N34). No diagnostic.
@layout: { engine: tree }
a: "A"
b: "B"
c: "C"
d: "D"
a -> b
b -> c
c -> a
b -> d: "second"
